01 term-arena based.
   02 norm-term occurs 1 to 100000000 depending on term-cap.
      03 term-path binary-long unsigned.
      03 term-var binary-long unsigned.
      03 term-offset binary-long unsigned.
01 path-arena based.
   02 path-node occurs 1 to 100000000 depending on path-cap.
      03 path-var binary-long unsigned.
      03 path-tail binary-long unsigned.
